### Rider / Visual Studio / VS Code REST Client: click the run arrow next to a request.
@api = http://localhost:5080
@key = lab-dev-key

### Medications
GET {{api}}/api/medications

### All taper plans
GET {{api}}/api/taper-plans

### Preview a schedule (nothing is saved)
POST {{api}}/api/taper-plans/preview
Content-Type: application/json

{ "medicationCode": "CLM", "startingDailyDoseMg": 10, "weekCount": 3 }

### Save a plan (needs the API key)
POST {{api}}/api/taper-plans
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{key}}

{ "patientName": "Ana Pop", "medicationCode": "STR", "startingDailyDoseMg": 40, "weekCount": 4 }

### Save without the key: expect 401
POST {{api}}/api/taper-plans
Content-Type: application/json

{ "patientName": "No Key", "medicationCode": "STR", "startingDailyDoseMg": 40, "weekCount": 4 }

### Dose above the maximum: expect 400
POST {{api}}/api/taper-plans
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{key}}

{ "patientName": "Too High", "medicationCode": "NRV", "startingDailyDoseMg": 25, "weekCount": 4 }
